    {
      "id": "45459897",
      "title": "8_Populating Form Data",
      "lectureOrder": 62,
      "videoOrder": 62,
      "sourceHash": "f3b92e0c923de899d48371a155df72aaef382917d1b0c6065ba8cfa49d12e7ab",
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.04,
          "end": 1.61,
          "en": "Hey everyone!",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.61,
          "end": 5.51,
          "en": "So in this video we will be discussing about how to repopulate form data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.75,
          "end": 8,
          "en": "We already did work with our form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8,
          "end": 13.28,
          "en": "Now we are submitting our form and also we are doing server side validation in our controller portion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.28,
          "end": 20.48,
          "en": "But here in the front end portion we have a little issue like suppose I fill this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.57,
          "end": 24.56,
          "en": "Now if I remove the name you know that name field is required, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.56,
          "end": 31.25,
          "en": "So if I submit it as it is so what will happen is it will show us our validation message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 31.25,
          "end": 31.88,
          "en": "But look at here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 31.88,
          "end": 34.85,
          "en": "Our entire form has been resetted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 35.21,
          "end": 37.76,
          "en": "So previous value aren't there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.76,
          "end": 42.02,
          "en": "So there is a concept of repopulating by that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 42.41,
          "end": 49.37,
          "en": "What you can do is when you got a validation message, your previous, uh, text, or you can say data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 49.49,
          "end": 52.19,
          "en": "will be inside your input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 52.19,
          "end": 55.37,
          "en": "It will not go away, but still you will get the validation message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 55.37,
          "end": 63.62,
          "en": "So what will happen is in user side, user will get a little bit of convenience that he have his old",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 63.62,
          "end": 66.74,
          "en": "data already filled in the input fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 66.77,
          "end": 68.87,
          "en": "Otherwise what what the user have to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 68.9,
          "end": 75.74,
          "en": "User have to again fill the entire form, even though he got a single error from the name input, but",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 75.74,
          "end": 83.21000000000001,
          "en": "still he have to fill the entire form to resubmit the form, which is not that convenient.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 83.99,
          "end": 84.95,
          "en": "So let's fix it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 84.98,
          "end": 87.53,
          "en": "So it is pretty much easy actually to work with.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 87.56,
          "end": 91.31,
          "en": "You just have to go to your blade portion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 92.33,
          "end": 95.39,
          "en": "And let's see here we have our input fields right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 95.39,
          "end": 100.88,
          "en": "So in the input field you will take a new attribute which will be value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 100.91,
          "end": 103.37,
          "en": "So why we use value attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 103.4,
          "end": 108.47,
          "en": "We use value value attribute for set default values for our input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 108.5,
          "end": 111.05,
          "en": "Like if I say hello in my name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 111.05,
          "end": 114.38,
          "en": "So what will happen if I go here in default and refresh this page?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 114.38,
          "end": 118.31,
          "en": "You'll be able to see the hello in a predefined in the input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 119.18,
          "end": 124.25,
          "en": "Now we have to make it dynamic so that it can recall the previous value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 124.31,
          "end": 131.36,
          "en": "Uh, when we submit it, I mean, when we are submitting submitting data from the form, if we got a",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 131.36,
          "end": 138.38,
          "en": "validation error, it will bring back those data and set those data in the input field automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 138.38,
          "end": 140.84,
          "en": "Also, it will show the validation error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 140.9,
          "end": 143,
          "en": "Validation is totally different part.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 143.03,
          "end": 147.82999999999998,
          "en": "We are already showing the validation error at the top so we don't have to worry about the validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 147.86,
          "end": 152.99,
          "en": "The main goal is to show the previous content in the input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 153.35,
          "end": 161.93,
          "en": "Okay, so for repopulate this input input field values, there is a prebuilt function in Laravel which",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 161.93,
          "end": 163.16,
          "en": "is called old.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 163.43,
          "end": 165.77,
          "en": "So old mint mean.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 165.77,
          "end": 169.85,
          "en": "Here we will show the old values of this input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 170.75,
          "end": 173.96,
          "en": "So in the old you have to provide a key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 173.99,
          "end": 176.63,
          "en": "The key will be basically the input field name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 176.63,
          "end": 183.92,
          "en": "So for for example for this input field name is name, so just put it here inside of it like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 184.13,
          "end": 186.11,
          "en": "Then we will go to the next one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 186.14,
          "end": 187.46,
          "en": "Let's take a value attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 187.49,
          "end": 188.72,
          "en": "Let's add curly braces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 188.72,
          "end": 190.61,
          "en": "Then we will call all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 190.76,
          "end": 196.76,
          "en": "And this one this one's name is email as you can see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 196.79,
          "end": 197.6,
          "en": "Right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 198.26,
          "end": 202.73,
          "en": "So you can just copy it and just paste it here email like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 202.73,
          "end": 204.14,
          "en": "Then we have the subject.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 204.14,
          "end": 206.18,
          "en": "So here we will add value as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 206.21,
          "end": 207.38,
          "en": "Again curly braces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 207.38,
          "end": 209,
          "en": "Let's put here old.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 209.87,
          "end": 213.17000000000002,
          "en": "And here we will say subject like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 213.2,
          "end": 214.97,
          "en": "The last one is the text area.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 214.97,
          "end": 220.43,
          "en": "And for the text area I hope you know for the text area there isn't any kind of value attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 220.46,
          "end": 225.17000000000002,
          "en": "You have to always put your value in between text area tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 225.17000000000002,
          "end": 230.69,
          "en": "So let's add here old and we will say message like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 230.69,
          "end": 231.86,
          "en": "That's pretty much it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 231.86,
          "end": 237.47,
          "en": "Rest of the thing this method will I mean function will handle by itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 238.7,
          "end": 241.66,
          "en": "So if I now go here if I remove this portion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 241.69,
          "end": 242.98,
          "en": "Refresh this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 243.01,
          "end": 245.56,
          "en": "We will fill the form one more time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 245.59,
          "end": 247.39,
          "en": "Let's fill it like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 247.42,
          "end": 251.8,
          "en": "Now if I remove the name fields and submit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 252.4,
          "end": 254.08,
          "en": "So we got a validation error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 254.11,
          "end": 256.6,
          "en": "Still our data remains there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 257.83,
          "end": 260.35,
          "en": "Our name is empty because we are submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 260.38,
          "end": 260.74,
          "en": "Empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 260.74,
          "end": 263.83,
          "en": "And we are getting the validation message as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 263.86,
          "end": 268.63,
          "en": "So from now, when we will submit the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 268.75,
          "end": 270.73,
          "en": "If we have any kind of error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 271.6,
          "end": 275.11,
          "en": "So our previous data will be there inside the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 275.11,
          "end": 278.02,
          "en": "It will not be set the form entirely.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 278.11,
          "end": 282.88,
          "en": "So how it is happening when we are sending the request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 283.15,
          "end": 284.40999999999997,
          "en": "We are submitting the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 284.40999999999997,
          "end": 286.84000000000003,
          "en": "We are passing all of the data in our controller set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 286.87,
          "end": 287.2,
          "en": "Right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 287.2,
          "end": 292.84000000000003,
          "en": "So from the controller side, when we are getting a validation error, it is passing the all the fields,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 292.84000000000003,
          "end": 295.51,
          "en": "all the previous fields and the error messages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 295.87,
          "end": 298.09000000000003,
          "en": "Um, in the front end portion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 298.81,
          "end": 305.2,
          "en": "And what this old function is doing is basically, this old function is getting those values from the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 305.2,
          "end": 310.3,
          "en": "session, and it is putting the, uh, those in our name field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 310.81,
          "end": 314.32,
          "en": "So that's pretty much it for the repopulating form data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 314.35,
          "end": 320.29,
          "en": "I hope you understand this is really handy when we are working with our form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 320.47,
          "end": 326.02,
          "en": "Uh, no matter where it is backend frontend, we always try to use this old method because it makes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 326.02,
          "end": 327.61,
          "en": "life really easy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 327.64,
          "end": 329.8,
          "en": "Who is creating or submitting the form?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 329.8,
          "end": 336.22,
          "en": "Suppose a form have 20 fields and the user got a validation error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 336.22,
          "end": 339.49,
          "en": "So what will happen is entire form will be reset.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 339.76,
          "end": 341.86,
          "en": "Reset it for only one mistake.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 341.86,
          "end": 345.52,
          "en": "So which he have to refill again for?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 345.52,
          "end": 351.34000000000003,
          "en": "Submit the form which is really unnecessary interaction with the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 351.34000000000003,
          "end": 352.48,
          "en": "So we don't want that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 352.48,
          "end": 355.33,
          "en": "That's why we use this old method in our input fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 355.33,
          "end": 357.01,
          "en": "So that's pretty much it for this video.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 357.01,
          "end": 358.12,
          "en": "I hope you understand.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 358.12,
